          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "NHS orders AI-related close-sourcing of hundreds of GitHub repositories over Anthropic security concerns",
            "articleSection": "Policy & Rights",
            "abstract": "The UK's National Health Service has issued a directive requiring technology leaders to wall off hundreds of its open-source GitHub repositories, citing concerns about advanced AI capabilities and specifically referencing Anthropic's Mythos. All maintainers have been given a May deadline to enact the change. The move marks one of the largest government-mandated AI-driven open-source restrictions by a public health body anywhere in the world.",
            "url": "https://go.theregister.com/feed/www.theregister.com/2026/05/05/nhs_to_closesource_hundreds_of_repos/",
